yuan，直接读「圆」yuán。",story:"圆圆的足球、圆盘和满月一样滚圆，记好整体音节 yuán。",toneForms:["yuān","yuán","yuǎn","yuàn"],exampleTone:2,layers:[[i("football"),44,56,34,"hop"],["art/play/plate.webp",70,62,26,"float"]]},"whole-yin":{group:"整体认读音节",backdrop:"phonics-grove",time:"day",atmosphere:"none",rhyme:"动听音乐 yin yin yin",mouthTip:"整体认读！前鼻音轻轻收在舌尖，直接读「音」yīn。",story:"清脆的音符在森林树枝间跳跃，小铃铛跟着和声 yīn。",toneForms:["yīn","yín","yǐn","yìn"],exampleTone:1,layers:[[i("music"),48,48,36,"rise"],[i("bell"),71,56,26,"sway"]]},"whole-yun":{group:"整体认读音节",backdrop:"tone-hills",time:"dawn",atmosphere:"clouds",rhyme:"天上白云 yun yun yun",mouthTip:"大 y 牵手 ün 时 ü 去掉两点变成 yun，直接读「云」yún。",story:"松软的白云悠闲飘过青山顶，带着太阳公公去旅行 yún。",toneForms:["yūn","yún","yǔn","yùn"],exampleTone:2,layers:[[i("cloud"),48,38,36,"drift",6,0],[i("dream-cloud"),72,46,22,"float"]]},"whole-ying":{group:"整体认读音节",backdrop:"lushan-waterfall",time:"day",atmosphere:"wind",rhyme:"小鹰高飞 ying ying ying",mouthTip:"后鼻音整体认读！直接一口读出「鹰」yīng。",story:"勇敢的小鸟迎着山风飞过高高青山，声音传得很远 yīng。",toneForms:["yīng","yíng","yǐng","yìng"],exampleTone:1,layers:[["art/play/bird.webp",48,38,32,"fly",8,-4],["art/play/mountain.webp",68,60,32,"idle"]]}},S=[{id:"动物",englishName:"Animals",subtitle:"cat · dog · rabbit",cover:"art/play/canopy.webp",badgeArt:"art/wordbook/painted/ginger-cat.webp"},{id:"食物",englishName:"Food",subtitle:"apple · milk · bread",cover:"art/play/orchard.webp",badgeArt:"art/wordbook/painted/apple.webp"},{id:"家人和身体",englishName:"Family & Body",subtitle:"mom · dad · hand",cover:"art/clearing.webp",badgeArt:"art/wordbook/painted/mother.webp"},{id:"日常用品",englishName:"Daily Things",subtitle:"book · ball · hat",cover:"art/poems/bg-spring-garden.webp",badgeArt:"art/play/satchel.webp"},{id:"颜色",englishName:"Colors",subtitle:"red · blue · yellow",cover:"art/wordbook/meadow.webp",badgeArt:"art/wordbook/painted/palette.webp"},{id:"动作和问候",englishName:"Actions & Hello",subtitle:"run · jump · hello",cover:"art/poems/bg-goose-pond.webp",badgeArt:"art/wordbook/painted/runner.webp"}],Q=Obje