h your ear.",phraseZh:"用耳朵听一听。",story:"竖起小耳朵，听见树林里清脆的铃铛和音符声。",heroArt:e("ear"),layers:[[e("ear"),46,55,38,"float"],[e("bell"),71,44,24,"sway"]]},"en-nose":{group:"家人和身体",backdrop:"spring-garden",time:"day",atmosphere:"petals",phonics:"n · o · se",phrase:"Smell with your nose.",phraseZh:"用小鼻子闻一闻。",story:"小鼻子轻轻凑到花朵旁边，闻到一阵阵淡淡花香。",heroArt:e("nose"),layers:[[e("nose"),44,52,36,"float"],[e("tulip"),70,58,30,"sway"]]},"en-mouth":{group:"家人和身体",backdrop:"clearing",time:"day",atmosphere:"none",phonics:"m · ou · th",phrase:"Smile and say hello!",phraseZh:"张嘴微笑说你好！",story:"张开嘴巴欢快唱歌说话，用清亮声音说出英语词。",heroArt:"art/wordbook/mouth.webp",layers:[["art/wordbook/mouth.webp",46,56,38,"pulse"],[e("talk"),72,38,24,"float"]]},"en-book":{group:"日常用品",backdrop:"clearing",time:"day",atmosphere:"none",phonics:"b · oo · k",phrase:"Open your picture book!",phraseZh:"翻开你的绘本书！",story:"厚厚的森林绘本打开啦，书页里藏着小兔和小蓝鸟。",heroArt:e("book"),layers:[[e("book"),48,56,38,"float"],[e("closed-book"),74,62,24,"idle"]]},"en-pencil":{group:"日常用品",backdrop:"spring-garden",time:"day",atmosphere:"none",phonics:"pen · cil",phrase:"Draw with a pencil.",phraseZh:"用铅笔画一画。",story:"削尖的小木铅笔在笔记本上画出美丽的图形和线条。",heroArt:e("pencil"),layers:[[e("pencil"),45,53,38,"sway"],[e("notebook"),71,60,28,"float"]]},"en-bag":{group:"日常用品",backdrop:"clearing",time:"dawn",atmosphere:"clouds",phonics:"b · a · g",phrase:"Pack your school bag!",phraseZh:"背好小书包出发！",story:"绿叶小书包里装着课本和铅笔，准备去森林学校啦。",heroArt:"art/play/satchel.webp",layers:[["art/play/satchel.webp",46,56,38,"float"],[e("book"),73,60,24,"hop"]]},"en-ball":{group:"日常用品",backdrop:"meadow",time:"day",atmosphere:"clouds",phonics:"b · a · ll",phrase:"Kick the ball!",phraseZh:"踢起圆圆的小球！",story:"黑白相间的足球在绿茵草地上滚来滚去弹得高高。",heroArt:e("football"),layers:[[e("football"),48,58,36,"hop",8,-3],[e("grass"),74,66,20,"sway"]]},"en-cup":{group:"日常用品",backdrop:"spring-garden",time:"dawn",atmosphere:"petals",phonics:"c · u · p",phrase:"A pretty cup.",phraseZh:"一个漂亮的小杯子。",story:"画着小白花的青瓷小茶杯盛着温热饮品，旁有玻璃水杯。",heroArt:e("