n"),28,58,28,"idle"]]},"en-brown":{group:"颜色",backdrop:"clearing",time:"dusk",atmosphere:"leaves",phonics:"br · ow · n",phrase:"Brown like a forest bear!",phraseZh:"像森林小熊一样棕褐！",story:"小棕熊抱着香香的栗子坐在木桩旁，全是暖暖的 brown！",heroArt:"art/bear.webp",swatchColor:"#8b5a34",layers:[["art/bear.webp",46,56,40,"hop"],["art/nut.webp",70,62,22,"float"],[e("log"),25,65,22,"idle"]]},"en-gray":{group:"颜色",backdrop:"storm",time:"mist",atmosphere:"clouds",phonics:"gr · ay",phrase:"Gray like a gentle elephant!",phraseZh:"像憨厚的大象一样灰灰！",story:"大象、小老鼠和溪边的鹅卵石，都是沉稳安静的 gray！",heroArt:e("elephant"),swatchColor:"#838d93",layers:[[e("elephant"),46,56,40,"idle"],[e("stone"),73,64,24,"idle"],[e("field-mouse"),24,67,18,"hop"]]},"en-run":{group:"动作和问候",backdrop:"orchard",time:"day",atmosphere:"wind",phonics:"r · u · n",phrase:"Run fast to the flag!",phraseZh:"快跑冲向终点旗！",story:"小运动健将甩开胳膊大步奔跑 run，很快就要冲过终点啦。",heroArt:e("runner"),layers:[[e("runner"),42,56,38,"hop",10,0],[e("finish-flag"),74,52,32,"sway"]]},"en-jump":{group:"动作和问候",backdrop:"goose-pond",time:"day",atmosphere:"ripples",phonics:"j · u · mp",phrase:"Jump high like a frog!",phraseZh:"像小青蛙一样高高跳起！",story:"青蛙蹬一蹬后腿扑通 jump，一下跳上碧绿大荷叶。",heroArt:e("frog"),layers:[[e("frog"),48,49,34,"hop",4,-8],["art/play/lily.webp",54,68,24,"float"]]},"en-sit":{group:"动作和问候",backdrop:"clearing",time:"day",atmosphere:"none",phonics:"s · i · t",phrase:"Please sit down.",phraseZh:"请坐下来休息。",story:"把小木椅拉近桌面，安安静静坐下来翻开书本 sit。",heroArt:e("chair"),layers:[[e("chair"),45,58,38,"idle"],[e("calm-child"),70,56,32,"idle"]]},"en-stand":{group:"动作和问候",backdrop:"meadow",time:"day",atmosphere:"clouds",phonics:"st · a · nd",phrase:"Stand up tall!",phraseZh:"挺直腰板站起来！",story:"两位好朋友站得笔直像小树苗一样神气 stand。",heroArt:e("boy"),layers:[[e("boy"),42,56,38,"idle"],[e("girl"),64,56,36,"idle"]]},"en-look":{group:"动作和问候",backdrop:"canopy",time:"day",atmosphere:"petals",phonics:"l · oo · k",phrase:"Look closely!",phraseZh:"仔细看一看！",story:"举起放大镜睁大眼睛仔细 look，发现了蝴蝶翅膀上的花纹。",heroArt:e("magnifier"),layers:[[e("magnifier"),44,56,34,"float"],[e("butterfly"),70,44,26,"flutter"]]},"en-listen":{group:"动作和问候",backdrop:"canopy",time:"dawn",atmosphere:"none",phonics:"lis · ten",phrase:"Listen to the music!",phraseZh:"仔细听美妙的音乐！",story:"侧起耳朵认真 listen，树林里飘来叮咚悦耳的小曲子。",heroArt:e("ear"),layers:[[e("ear"),44,56,36,"float"],[e("music"),69,42,26,"rise"]]},"en-eat":{group:"动作和问候",backdrop:"orchard",time:"day",atmosphere:"clouds",phonics:"ea · t",phrase:"Let's eat tasty food!",phraseZh:"一起开开心心吃美食！",story:"小勺盛起热气腾腾的美食，香喷喷地吃起来 eat。",heroArt:e("rice-bowl"),layers:[[e("rice-bowl"),46,58,34,"float"],[e("spoon"),70,48,28,"sway"]]},"en-drink":{group:"动作和问候",backdrop:"clearing",time:"dawn",atmosphere:"clouds",phonics:"dr · i · nk",phrase:"Drink a cup of milk.",phraseZh:"喝一杯香浓牛奶。",story:"捧起装满鲜奶或清茶的杯子咕嘟咕嘟喝一口 drink。",heroArt:e("milk-glass"),layers:[[e("milk-glass"),48,56,36,"float"],[e("tea-cup"),73,62,24,"idle"]]},"en-hello":{group:"动作和问候",backdrop:"spring-garden",time:"dawn",atmosphere:"petals",phonics:"hel · lo",phrase:"Hello, my friend!",phraseZh:"你好呀，我的朋友！",story:"露出灿烂笑容挥挥手，热情地对森林小伙伴说 hello！",heroArt:e("smiling-child"),layers:[[e("smiling-child"),45,55,40,"hop"],["art/wordbook/palm.webp",72,46,26,"sway"],[e("talk"),26,34,20,"float"]]},"en-goodbye":{group:"动作和问候",backdrop:"frontier-dusk",time:"dusk",atmosphere:"leaves",phonics:"good · bye",phrase:"Goodbye, see you soon!",phraseZh:"再见，明天见！",story:"夕阳下挥挥小手告别，背上小书包欢快回家 goodbye。",heroArt:e("girl"),layers:[[e("girl"),46,56,40,"hop"],["art/wordbook/palm.webp",72,45,25,"sway"]]}},R=[{amount:0,mnemonic:"像鸡蛋",tint:"#fbf3df",image:"art/numbers/num-0.webp"},{amount:1,mnemonic:"像铅笔",tint:"#fcf4dc",image:"art/numbers/num-1.webp"},{amount:2,mnemonic:"像小鸭",tint:"#f1f6ef",image:"art/numbers/num-2.webp"},{amount:3,mnemonic:"像耳朵",tint:"#fcf1e4",image:"art/numbers/num-3.webp"},{amount:4,mnemonic:"像小旗",tint:"#f8f3e8",image:"art/numbers/num-4.webp"},{amount:5,mnemonic:"像秤钩",tint:"#f7f3df",image:"art/numbers/num-5.webp"},{amount:6,mnemonic:"像哨子",tint:"#eff5ee",image:"art/n